prompts.user_prefix:
I am going to give you multiple LaTeX documents to revise. Please read all documents carefully.

Here are the LaTeX documents with additional LaTeX auxiliary files (where the math commands are defined):

<documents>
{AUXILIARY_FILE_CONTENTS}
{ADDITIONAL_INPUT_CONTENTS}
<document name="{INPUT_FILE}">
{INPUT_CONTENT}
</document>
</documents>

Please carefully read through all the research papers above and ensure you fully understand all the details.
Your task is to enhance these papers focusing solely on the following specific instruction:
<instruction>
{INSTRUCTION}
</instruction>
For example, in the instruction, if I ask you to revise section A in all papers, you do not need to revise section B in any paper.

The output files should be in the following order: OUTPUT_FILES_ORDER={OUTPUT_FILES_ORDER}
